---

Third-party components, none of which are vendored into this repository:

* The detector weights (`yolov8n.onnx`) are AGPL-3.0 (Ultralytics YOLOv8n COCO
  export). They are fetched at image-build time by the Dockerfile's `models`
  stage with an optional digest pin and are never committed here. A model card
  recording the license travels with the image.
* The face model (`yunet.onnx`) is Apache-2.0 and is fetched the same way.
* `ed25519_verifier.py`, which ships inside every export bundle, is authored in
  this repository under this MIT license as a verify-only implementation of the
  RFC 8032 §5.1.7 algorithm. No third-party code is vendored into it.
